      { intent: 'lamb soup with bread', zh: '羊肉泡馍', pinyin: 'Yángròu pàomó', en: "Crumbled flatbread soaked in rich lamb broth — Xi'an's signature", it: "Pane sbriciolato in brodo ricco di agnello — il piatto simbolo di Xi'an" },
